	measure 'Current vs Previous Month (Billable Hrs %)' = ```
			
			VAR quotient =
			DIVIDE(
			    [Current Month (Billable Hrs)],
			    [Previous Month (Billable Hrs)],
			    BLANK()
			)
			RETURN
			IF(
			    NOT ISBLANK([Current vs Previous Month (Billable Hrs)]),
			    quotient - 1, 
			    BLANK()
			)
			```
		formatString: 0.0%;-0.0%;0.0%
		displayFolder: [3] Time Details Analysis
		lineageTag: b2554ff2-cd98-4735-b57b-0d241b3734da

